#: website/public/blog/reverse-engineering-models/index.html:826
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:blog/reverse-engineering-models/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Compiler knowledge:{ph1} {ph2}TH095 identifier-bucket reuse{ph3}, "
"{ph4}TH04 player source and linker order{ph5} and {ph6}Luna's TH09 enemy-"
